arehouse go-live phase. They agreed to prepare a deadline and go-live map for Savita to clarify the plan. The group expressed appreciation for the insights gained from the sessions, emphasizing the importance of interconnection between different sites for digitalization and transparency. They acknowledged the complexity but remained optimistic about future outcomes. The group discussed holiday plans and who would be available to address any arising questions. The session concluded with plans for future discussions and a farewell until the next meeting."
